/data/lore/misc.lua（固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，lore id=\"renegade-pyromancers-vault\"，第 682 行）确认原文确含 in each，且第 670 行配料表为 10 pouches faeros ash、第 671 行 5 vials fire wyrm saliva，与「每瓶 2 袋」用量一致。同句另有 heating it so that it brands the shape of--- 被译为「加热，构成类似于—」，brands（烙出…形状）的语义丢失。"},{"revision_key":"893466d871ba56e24e665df3705035cc0bcc70e67219acabab20e5acaea93a74","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"89404556c30a1fac68a848ddd8faf471abf8fbc53f5d1207e130546a68592648","verdict":"OK"}]}